WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
Why don't you go to the city center?

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,520
Those big shopping malls have a lot of stuff

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,560
Search and buy good wine

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,460
Why is there so much stuff in the city center?

5
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:09,980
You don't know how to think about it

6
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:12,460
There are many people and there is great demand, so there are more goods to stock up on.

7
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:14,740
The more people there are, the more losses there are

8
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:18,100
Do you want to see the corpses piled higher than the building go away?

9
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,000
Out of this door

10
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:25,970
It’s not a matter of being strong. Xu Qing

11
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:27,410
Tell me again the information about your car

12
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:29,130
The parking lot at the far corner of South Gate

13
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:30,890
Parking space No. 18 is located in the north.

14
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:32,090
There are two spaces left in the sea

15
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:33,570
My watch can be unlocked via Bluetooth

16
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:35,730
The battery can last for a day, remember

17
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:49,940
If there is too much loss in the parking lot, Jiang Xue will clear the way. I will carry you and you will be surrounded. I will give up and find another one and retreat. Then stay where you are.
